'''Italy''' is the 24th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Boogie Cat]] will be available to unlock in the [[Upgrade Menu]].

