==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Fukui Prefecture'''.
*Fukui Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Tōjinbō|Tōjinbō]], a series of rugged cliffs along the Sea of Japan just north of Fukui City, Fukui Prefecture.

